    "result_text": "`AcceptanceTest` is the only test class, and it passes along with the whole build. \n\nThe change is complete:\n\n1. **`Owner.java`** \u2014 added a derived `getTelephoneDisplay()` that formats the stored E.164 `telephone` for humans: country code, a space, then national digits grouped in threes (`+61412345678` \u2192 `+61 412 345 678`). Returns `null` for absent/invalid values, and the raw `telephone` getter is untouched.\n\n2. **`openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a `readOnly` `telephoneDisplay` string to the `Owner` schema so it's generated into `OwnerDto`. MapStruct maps it automatically from the matching `getTelephoneDisplay()` getter (same mechanism as `ageBand`, `locality`, `identityKey`, etc.).\n\nThe acceptance test `coreFormatsTelephoneDisplay` passes: `$.telephone` = `+61412345678` (raw E.164) and `$.telephoneDisplay` = `+61 412 345 678` (formatted). Full build is `BUILD SUCCESS`.",
